---
// src/pages/ministry-model.astro — The Ministry Model
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
import PullQuote from '../components/PullQuote.astro';
import Callout from '../components/Callout.astro';
import Reveal from '../components/Reveal.astro';
import CTASection from '../components/CTASection.astro';

const rhythm = [
  'Worship and Scripture',
  'Rest without agenda',
  'Shared meals',
  'Honest conversation',
  'Personal ministry and prayer',
  'Wise counsel',
  'Time outdoors',
  'Space to hear God',
];

const whoIsReceived = [
  'Pastors and ministry leaders',
  'Missionaries',
  'Intercessors and watchmen',
  'Chaplains',
  'Ministry families',
  'Educators',
  'Public servants',
  'Marketplace leaders',
];

const formation = [
  'Abiding in Christ',
  'Renewing the mind through Scripture',
  'Learning to hear and obey God',
  'Receiving correction without shame',
  'Confronting hidden compromise',
  'Practicing forgiveness',
  'Stewarding resources faithfully',
  'Becoming dependable in God-given responsibility',
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The Ministry Model"
  description="Shared life, deep formation, faithful sending. The Ember Ridge ministry model draws from the Acts 2 pattern: Scripture, fellowship, shared meals, prayer, generosity, and daily faithfulness."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="The Ministry Model"
    title="Shared Life, Deep Formation, Faithful Sending"
    lede="The life of Ember Ridge will draw from the Acts 2 pattern: devotion to Scripture, fellowship, shared meals, prayer, generosity, and daily faithfulness."
  />

  <Section tone="ivory" labelledby="proximity-heading">
    <div class="shell">
      <Reveal>
        <SectionHeading
          id="proximity-heading"
          eyebrow="Shared Life"
          title="Transformation often requires time, proximity, and healthy relationship"
        />
      </Reveal>
      <div class="mt-12">
        <Prose>
          <p>
            Guests will not come merely to attend sessions and leave with notes. They
            will enter a prayerful household rhythm — one that makes room for the Holy
            Spirit to work at a depth that scheduled gatherings rarely allow.
          </p>
        </Prose>
      </div>

      <Reveal delay="100" class="mt-12 grid gap-x-8 gap-y-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {rhythm.map((item) => (
          <div class="border-t border-stone-200 pt-4">
            <p class="font-display text-lg text-ink">{item}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </Reveal>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section tone="linen" labelledby="leaders-heading">
    <div class="shell">
      <Reveal>
        <SectionHeading
          id="leaders-heading"
          eyebrow="A Deliberate Focus"
          title="Investing deeply in a few so that many can be strengthened"
        />
      </Reveal>
      <div class="mt-12">
        <Prose>
          <p>
            A pastor restored in spirit returns to a congregation with greater health. A
            business owner who regains clarity can change the culture of a company. A
            school leader strengthened in truth can influence educators, families, and
            children. A marriage that heals can interrupt generational patterns.
          </p>
          <p>
            By serving those who carry responsibility for others, Ember Ridge invests
            deeply in a few so that many can be strengthened through them.
          </p>
        </Prose>
      </div>

      <Reveal delay="100" class="mt-12">
        <h3 class="font-sans text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-700">
          The house will receive, as the Lord directs
        </h3>
        <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-x-8 gap-y-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
          {whoIsReceived.map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[0.9375rem] text-ink">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-500"></span>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </Reveal>

      <Callout title="How placements work">
        <p>
          Placements will be limited and prayerfully discerned rather than publicly
          marketed for volume. Ember Ridge will operate primarily through trusted
          relationships, referrals, and word of mouth. The length and structure of each
          stay will be established with the guest and leadership according to need,
          capacity, safety, and the leading of the Holy Spirit. Stays are intended to be
          purposeful seasons of restoration and formation, not permanent residency.
        </p>
      </Callout>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section tone="cream" labelledby="formation-heading">
    <div class="shell">
      <Reveal>
        <SectionHeading
          id="formation-heading"
          eyebrow="Deep Formation"
          title="Love will be the governing culture"
        />
      </Reveal>
      <div class="mt-12">
        <Prose>
          <p>
            Jesus welcomed people fully and also called them into truth, repentance,
            maturity, and obedience. The formation offered at Ember Ridge follows that
            pattern.
          </p>
        </Prose>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {formation.map((item, i) => (
          <Reveal delay={i * 50}>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-5 border-l border-stone-200 py-1 pl-5">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display text-lg text-gold-700">
                {String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
              </span>
              <p class="text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-ink">{item}</p>
            </div>
          </Reveal>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14">
        <Prose>
          <p>
            Guests may receive teaching in strategic prayer, biblical discernment,
            prophecy, healing ministry, intercession, leadership, marriage, family
            stewardship, organizational health, and the practical responsibilities of
            serving people well. Yet the goal will never be knowledge alone. The goal is
            a life more deeply rooted in Christ.
          </p>
        </Prose>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section tone="stone" id="sending" labelledby="sending-heading">
    <div class="shell">
      <Reveal>
        <SectionHeading
          id="sending-heading"
          eyebrow="Faithful Sending"
          title="The sending is as important as the receiving"
        />
      </Reveal>
      <div class="mt-12">
        <Prose>
          <p>
            Ember Ridge does not exist to gather people around itself. It exists to
            strengthen them for their own homes, churches, workplaces, schools,
            ministries, and regions.
          </p>
          <p>
            Some may return periodically for renewal. Some may become long-term prayer
            partners or friends of the work. A smaller number may be called to serve
            within the ongoing community. In every case, the desired fruit is
            faithfulness to the assignment God has already given.
          </p>
        </Prose>

        <PullQuote>
          What God restores at Ember Ridge is not meant to remain on the mountain.
        </PullQuote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <CTASection
    eyebrow="Placements"
    title="Referrals and enquiries"
    body="Placements are limited and prayerfully discerned. If you are carrying someone who needs this, or carrying it yourself, start a conversation."
    primary={{ label: 'Contact leadership', href: '/contact' }}
    secondary={{ label: 'The house of prayer', href: '/house-of-prayer' }}
  />
</BaseLayout>
